# Optimization

Minimize tokens and wall-clock. User instructions in `AGENTS.md` override skills.

## Context

- Grep/search before opening files. Read the smallest range that answers the question.
- Do not load `build/`, `.gradle/`, minified bundles, lockfiles, `.archives`, `.backups`, or `.superpowers/sdd`.
- Do not read Constitution, Calibration, INDEX, pantry, or network/debug specs unless this task needs them.
- Do not duplicate unchanged code in replies.

## Time

- No extra agents (review, Bugbot, security-review, explore-the-whole-repo) unless the user asks.
- No full test suites, `npm run build`, `build:crx`, deploy, PM2, ADB, or SSH unless the change requires that proof or the user asks.
- Cap probes at ~25s. Do not soak, poll, or sleep unless asked.
- One narrow check beats a compatibility matrix.

## Output

- Default: 1 confirmation line, or 2–4 bullets (changed / checked / blocker).
- Do not write `BUGFIX*`, `SUMMARY*`, `CHECKLIST*`, `REPORT*`, `FINAL*` files unless asked.

## CWSP

- Protocol: `.cursor/rules/network.mdc` (not always-on).
- Recovery: `.cursor/rules/debugging.mdc` (not always-on).
- Do not re-run green `check:*` scripts unless related code changed.
